          "short": "$\\frac{2}{15}$",
          "worked": "Of the multiples of $5$, exclude $15$ and $30$ because they are divisible by $3$. The favourable outcomes are $5,10,20,25$.\n\n$P(\\text{divisible by }5\\text{ but not }3)=\\frac{4}{30}=\\frac{2}{15}$.",
